From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:11:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/27] Mobile: Add switchable test logging with export

A "Test logging" settings section with a master switch and one switch
per feature (shopping list database, relays, sync, Bluetooth, invites,
screens, note tiles). Entries go to a ring buffer and a rotating file in
the profile directory, so they survive a crash; they can be viewed,
filtered, cleared and shared as a text file.

